---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | GoldShore"
  description="Terms governing use of GoldShore platform services, SEL signal feed, and paper-trading simulation."
  canonicalPath="/legal/terms"
>
  <section class="gs-section gs-shell-section legal-prose">
    <div class="legal-inner">
      <p class="gs-eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <p>These Terms of Service (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) govern your access to and use of the products and services provided by GoldShore Labs (&ldquo;GoldShore,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;), including the GoldShore platform, Systematic Earnings Logic (SEL) signal feed, paper-trading simulation environment, developer API, and any associated websites or tooling (collectively, the &ldquo;Services&rdquo;).</p>
      <p>By accessing or using any Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, you may not use the Services.</p>

      <h2>1. Services Offered</h2>
      <p>GoldShore provides the following categories of services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consulting and implementation engagements</strong> — scoped delivery projects for operational AI, automation, and infrastructure modernization, as described in individual statements of work or service agreements.</li>
        <li><strong>SEL Signal Feed (SaaS)</strong> — a subscription-based AI-powered earnings signal service that analyzes earnings call transcripts, guidance revisions, and options flow to generate pre- and post-earnings trade signals delivered via API, webhook, or the GoldShore dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong>Paper-trading simulation</strong> — a multi-agent trading simulation environment using live market data from connected read-only brokerage accounts. No live trading or real order execution is performed. All positions and P&amp;L are simulated.</li>
        <li><strong>Developer infrastructure</strong> — APIs, webhooks, and developer tooling for integrating GoldShore data and signal services into third-party systems.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Accounts and Access</h2>
      <p>Access to GoldShore services is provisioned via Cloudflare Access (SSO). You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account. You must:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide accurate and complete information during account setup.</li>
        <li>Keep your credentials and OAuth tokens confidential.</li>
        <li>Notify us immediately at <a href="mailto:legal@goldshore.ai">legal@goldshore.ai</a> if you suspect unauthorized access.</li>
        <li>Ensure that any users you authorize to access GoldShore services on behalf of your organization comply with these Terms.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms, are associated with fraudulent activity, or create security risk for the platform.</p>

      <h2>3. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reverse-engineer, decompile, disassemble, or attempt to derive the source code of any GoldShore service or model.</li>
        <li>Use automated scripts, bots, or scrapers to access or extract data from GoldShore interfaces beyond the documented API rate limits.</li>
        <li>Resell, sublicense, or redistribute GoldShore signal data, API responses, or dashboard content without written authorization.</li>
        <li>Use the Services to transmit malware, conduct denial-of-service attacks, or otherwise interfere with platform integrity.</li>
        <li>Attempt to circumvent authentication, access controls, or billing systems.</li>
        <li>Use the Services in violation of any applicable law or regulation, including securities laws in your jurisdiction.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Paper Trading — Simulation Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The GoldShore paper-trading environment is a <strong>simulation only</strong>. It is designed for strategy testing and educational purposes. Specifically:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>No real orders are placed with any broker, exchange, or market participant.</li>
        <li>No real funds are at risk. Simulated portfolio values are not redeemable or transferable.</li>
        <li>Live market data is used for price feeds, but execution is simulated against modeled slippage and fill assumptions that may not reflect actual market conditions.</li>
        <li><strong>The paper-trading platform does not constitute financial advice, investment advice, or a recommendation to buy or sell any security.</strong></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. SEL Signal Feed — Signal Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The Systematic Earnings Logic (SEL) signal feed provides AI-generated analytical signals derived from publicly available earnings data and options flow. These signals are provided for <strong>informational purposes only</strong>. Specifically:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>SEL signals are <strong>not investment advice</strong>, financial advice, or a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any security.</li>
        <li><strong>Past signal performance does not guarantee future results.</strong> Historical backtest data reflects modeled performance under historical conditions and is not predictive of future outcomes.</li>
        <li>Options and earnings-related trading carries significant risk. You may lose some or all capital invested in real trading activity informed by these signals.</li>
        <li>You are solely responsible for any investment decisions you make. GoldShore is not a registered investment adviser, broker-dealer, or financial planner.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Payments and Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>Subscription and project billing is processed by Stripe. By providing payment information, you authorize GoldShore to charge the applicable fees on the agreed billing cycle. Additional terms:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Subscriptions</strong> renew automatically at the end of each billing period unless cancelled before the renewal date.</li>
        <li><strong>Project billing</strong> is governed by the applicable statement of work or engagement agreement.</li>
        <li>All fees are non-refundable except as required by applicable law or as explicitly stated in your service agreement.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to update pricing with 30 days' notice to active subscribers.</li>
        <li>Failure to pay may result in suspension or termination of access.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p><strong>GoldShore's IP:</strong> GoldShore owns all rights to the platform, signal models, algorithms, dashboard software, APIs, and associated intellectual property. These Terms do not grant you any ownership interest in GoldShore's technology.</p>
      <p><strong>Your data:</strong> You retain ownership of data you input into GoldShore services (including trading configuration, portfolio settings, and API integrations). You grant GoldShore a limited license to process your data solely to provide the Services.</p>
      <p><strong>Feedback:</strong> Any feedback, suggestions, or ideas you provide to GoldShore may be used by us without restriction or compensation.</p>

      <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>GoldShore's total liability for any claim arising under these Terms is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim.</li>
        <li>GoldShore is not liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages, including loss of profits, data, or trading losses, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.</li>
        <li>GoldShore makes no warranty that the Services will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of security vulnerabilities.</li>
        <li>THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED &ldquo;AS IS&rdquo; WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
      <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless GoldShore, its officers, employees, and contractors from any claims, damages, losses, or expenses (including legal fees) arising from your use of the Services, your violation of these Terms, or your violation of any applicable law or third-party rights.</p>

      <h2>10. Termination</h2>
      <p>You may cancel your account at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:legal@goldshore.ai">legal@goldshore.ai</a>. GoldShore may suspend or terminate access for violation of these Terms, non-payment, or any reason with 30 days' notice (or immediately in cases of serious breach or security risk). Upon termination, your right to access the Services ceases. Data deletion follows the schedule in our Privacy Policy.</p>

      <h2>11. Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Delaware, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any dispute arising from these Terms or the Services shall be resolved exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Delaware. You waive any objection to jurisdiction or venue in those courts.</p>

      <h2>12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be communicated by email to account holders at least 14 days before they take effect. Continued use of the Services after the effective date constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h2>13. Contact</h2>
      <p>Legal inquiries should be directed to:</p>
      <p>
        GoldShore Labs<br />
        <a href="mailto:legal@goldshore.ai">legal@goldshore.ai</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-prose {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }
  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 80ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .meta {
    color: var(--gs-text-dim, rgba(255,255,255,0.45));
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .legal-inner h1 {
    margin: 0.3rem 0 0.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }
  .legal-inner h2 {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--gs-gold, #c9a84c);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-inner p,
  .legal-inner li {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--gs-text-dim, rgba(255,255,255,0.72));
  }
  .legal-inner ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .legal-inner li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal-inner a { color: var(--gs-blue, #5aa2ff); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .legal-inner a:hover { color: #fff; }
</style>
